 bearing fits applications requiring a compact 12x37x12mm envelope with moderate load capacity and high-speed capability, such as motors, pumps, gearboxes, and general power transmission equipment. Confirm shaft and housing tolerances, lubrication method, and environmental exposure against the open seal type before specifying for dirty or wet environments.", "bullets": ["MPN: SKF 6301 \u2014 single-row deep groove ball bearing", "Bore Diameter: 12 mm | Outer Diameter: 37 mm | Width: 12 mm", "Seal Type: Open (no integrated shields or seals)", "Ring Material: Chrome Steel (GCr15/52100); Cage Material: Steel", "Dynamic Load Rating (C): 9.75 kN | Static Load Rating (C0): 4.15 kN", "Limiting Speed: 26,000 rpm", "Max Operating Temperature: 120 C", "Precision Class: ABEC-1 / P0"], "meta_description": "SKF 6301 open deep groove ball bearing, 12x37x12mm, chrome steel, 9.75kN dynamic load, 26000 rpm, ABEC-1.", "keywords": ["SKF 6301", "deep groove ball bearing", "open bearing 12x37x12", "chrome steel bearing", "ABEC-1 bearing", "6301 bearing SKF"], "search_terms": ["SKF6301", "6301 bearing", "6301-open", "6301 open bearing", "SKF 6301 open", "12x37x12 bearing"]}, "issues": [{"code": "GEOMETRY_CONTRADICTION", "severity": "error", "field": "bore_diameter", "message": "Bore diameter (37.0 mm) is not smaller than outer diameter (12.0 mm).", "suggestion": "The two values are most likely transposed in the source data."}], "readiness": {"overall": 92.0, "completeness": 100.0, "confidence": 99.0, "validity": 78.0, "verdict": "blocked", "missing_required": [], "notes": ["1 blocking error(s) must be resolved before publication."]}, "trace": [{"stage": "normalize", "summary": "Cleaned input and resolved identity.", "duration_ms": 0, "added": ["mpn", "sku", "brand", "brand_country"], "changed": [], "details": {"identity": {"mpn": "6301", "sku": "3117-012", "brand": "SKF", "brand_country": "Sweden"}}}, {"stage": "classify", "summary": "Assigned to Industrial Components > Bearings & Power 